      "writtenOn": "2026-03-13T03:11:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice cache!\n\nThere is another issue, we should use `X2APIC_MSR(APIC_ISR) + APIC_ISR_NR - 1` rather than `X2APIC_MSR(APIC_ISR + APIC_ISR_NR - 1)` as APIC_ISR_NR is 0x8 but not 0x80, and shifting by `X2APIC_MSR` will result in an incorrect value.\n\nSo it should be:\n```\ncase X2APIC_MSR(APIC_ISR) ... X2APIC_MSR(APIC_ISR) + APIC_ISR_NR - 1:\ncase X2APIC_MSR(APIC_IRR) ... X2APIC_MSR(APIC_IRR) + APIC_ISR_NR - 1:\n```",
